{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The measures of the interior angles of a convex polygon are in arithmetic progression. \nIf the smallest angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b19d9486c9b7645405202c0869ec43682a65bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, and the largest is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/4886119534bab6d6981008596733884b1a9e42c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, then the number of sides the polygon has is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/801105885f134265602abff2210d0d0cb08a4f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }6\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }8\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }10\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }11\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equal the number of sides the polygon has. The sum of all the interior angles of a polygon is: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5eccfe73a52885542fe472750d0ea086d9b33eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180(n-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>The formula for an arithmetic series is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d8c8f98db25d83774d859957912ee43eb04e39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(a_1 + a_n)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />. Set this equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5eccfe73a52885542fe472750d0ea086d9b33eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180(n-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" /> and solve. In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/98947dba9c2c0b98a9939955c7d77b9b72126d87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/3128b6f3886ded3f047559e354b56b25dbf6421a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Our equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35f1e6000dc6e4b64b86b47aaf19cb5f5733cb27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(100+140)}{2} = 180(n-2) \\Rightarrow 240n = 360(n-2) \\Rightarrow 120n = 720$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"505\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb8a2da1fa6b2779cef0cdc08af745f570e9ef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"91\" height=\"28\" /> ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1976 AHSME Pr